6/10/1/womens-swimming-diving-west-virginia-opens-season-with-split-meets-hosting-marshall-at-virginia-tech</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/1/womens-swimming-diving-west-virginia-opens-season-with-split-meets-hosting-marshall-at-virginia-tech</guid><category>Men's Swimming &amp; Diving, Women's Swimming &amp; Diving</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Parker Sterlitz prepares to dive into the water from the starting block." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/1/918756357-gb701472.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University men's and women's swimming and diving teams begin the season with a home meet for the women's team against Marshall on Friday, Oct. 2, and a meet for the men's team against Virginia Tech with Penn State on Oct. 2-3, in Christiansburg, Virginia.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/1/918756357-gb701472.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/1/918756357-gb701472.jpg"><media:title>Parker Sterlitz prepares to dive into the water from the starting block.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/1/918756357-gb701472.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:08:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>14</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59469</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Set to Host Martha Thorn Invitational</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/1/tennis-mountaineers-set-to-host-martha-thorn-invitational</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/1/tennis-mountaineers-set-to-host-martha-thorn-invitational</guid><category>Tennis</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Head Coach Miha Lisac watching a match against UCF during the 2025-26 season" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/1/ex1_66.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University tennis team returns home this weekend for the Martha Thorn Invitational on Oct. 2-4 at the Mountaineer Tennis Courts.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/1/ex1_66.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/1/ex1_66.jpg"><media:title>Head Coach Miha Lisac watching a match against UCF during the 2025-26 season</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/1/ex1_66.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 1 Oct 2026 12:50:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>15</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59468</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Set for First Big 12 Road Test of the Season</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/1/volleyball-mountaineers-set-for-first-big-12-road-test-of-the-season</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/1/volleyball-mountaineers-set-for-first-big-12-road-test-of-the-season</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="The WVU Volleyball is huddled up before its match against TCU on Sept. 27" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/1/VB_WVUvsTCU_Sept27_2026_TT_83.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University volleyball team (8-4, 1-1 Big 12) heads to Lubbock, Texas, for its first Big 12 road test of the season, taking on Texas Tech (8-6, 0-2 Big 12) on Friday, Oct. 2, at United Supermarkets Arena. First serve is set for 7 p.m. ET.]]></description><media:t